{{tl|{{PAGENAME}}}} is a variant of {{Tl|Tl}} for templates which should be [[Wikipedia:Template substitution|substituted]] ''without'' any parameters. For substituted templates ''with'' parameters, try {{tl|Tlsx}}.

== Usage ==
 <nowiki>{{Tls|template name}}</nowiki>

== Example ==
{| class="wikitable"
! Code
! Result
|-
| {{Tlx|Tls|x4}}
| {{Tls|x4}}
|}

== TemplateData ==
{{TemplateData header}}
<templatedata>
{
	"description": "Template link with subst",
	"format": "inline",
	"params": {
		"1": {
			"label": "Template",
			"description": "Linked template name",
			"type": "wiki-template-name",
			"required": true
		}
	}
}
</templatedata>

